domain CONTRACT_COMPARISON:
  description "Compare existing awareness information delivery contracts before implementation."
evidence OWNER:
  "Owner requests contracts side by side and early detection; latest continuation resumes this scoped investigation."
evidence GUIDANCE:
  "Compiler stores consciousGuidance separately; old consumers overlay live projected guidance, awareness context reads static consciousSelf and receives actions and facts only."
evidence TEST:
  "Context fixture has empty guidance and only unaware coreNeeds; its positive assertion cannot establish delivery of applicable guidance or aware needs."
evidence INPUT:
  "Conscious schema requires arrays but no origin coverage or dialogue continuation; renderer serializes received fields."
premise LIMIT:
  "These observations establish a particular delivery omission and detection gap, not the root cause of monotonous battle behavior. Absence of a dedicated history field alone does not prove all dialogue disappears."
premise OPTIONS:
  "Adding labels alone preserves missing source information. Adding every source field leaks hidden traits. Comparing obligations to projection and validation allows conditional delivery and intentional exclusion to be distinguished."
decision NEXT based_on OWNER, GUIDANCE, TEST, INPUT, LIMIT, OPTIONS:
  "Write a bounded comparison and concrete repair candidate. Preserve source code, seals and unrelated WIP; no paid calls, deployment or blanket resealing."
